                    {
                        "translation_id": "df3643b3-a65a-41ae-b7b0-36a073c278eb",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9ebee38-164f-3fb3-bb4a-4e9a75492cc8",
                        "source_sense_id": "0348d133-a440-3f47-add5-32b019b2e8c8",
                        "target_lang_word": "evangelical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "evangelical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f091c7f4-8b27-394e-99e4-1ec8f759a114",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the doctrines or teachings of the Christian gospel or Christianity in general."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "664eb37b-30a6-3fdf-8579-4d0bd2580d9e",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the gospel(s) of the Christian New Testament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5658844b-34d4-3518-846e-9b662cb95508",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Protestant; specifically Lutheran and Calvinist churches in continental Europe as well as their offshoots in North America."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14db5b59-da2b-372e-a9ed-ddb3f872dbab",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to a movement in Protestant Christianity that stresses personal conversion and the authority of the Bible (evangelicalism)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c647a2e8-1858-48ec-a300-5c980dc62381",
                                                "sense_id": "14db5b59-da2b-372e-a9ed-ddb3f872dbab",
                                                "text": "“They wave their Bibles at passersby, screaming their condemnations,” writes Kurt Eichenwald of evangelical Christians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "291af922-59b9-3fb4-a4d7-e8c0fa0384d4",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to Islamic groups that are dedicated to dawah and preaching the Quran and sunnah."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfda4121-370f-4ecc-a155-641850097175",
                                                "sense_id": "291af922-59b9-3fb4-a4d7-e8c0fa0384d4",
                                                "text": "When the mosque came under the influence of an evangelical Muslim group (Jamaati Tableegh), the formerly congenial situation changed noticeably."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "620676b5-f367-3a32-a156-37eb2331bba3",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zealously enthusiastic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "evangelical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b60c92e3-fc33-373f-beaf-a2e4951d6881",
                                        "entry_id": "05b2b01e-0936-3637-ac3b-bf0708950593",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of an evangelical church."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d7c2314-640a-493f-a6fc-d34d67542e7e",
                                                "sense_id": "b60c92e3-fc33-373f-beaf-a2e4951d6881",
                                                "text": "Furthermore, what would otherwise be good points about the sort of selective literalism that renders homosexuality an unpardonable sin but shrugs off Sarah Palin’s biblically forbidden pearl earrings are lost in Eichenwald’s assumption that evangelicals make these decisions “with less care than they exercise in selecting side orders for lunch.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26b2dffb-c704-3b1a-96ad-d3e7a60f19a3",
                                        "entry_id": "05b2b01e-0936-3637-ac3b-bf0708950593",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate of evangelicalism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "21ac650b-b9aa-4243-aa04-a458ea1813df",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9ebee38-164f-3fb3-bb4a-4e9a75492cc8",
                        "source_sense_id": "0348d133-a440-3f47-add5-32b019b2e8c8",
                        "target_lang_word": "evangelík",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "24f75277-e49c-47ff-bcc2-8f39705c8995",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9ebee38-164f-3fb3-bb4a-4e9a75492cc8",
                        "source_sense_id": "0348d133-a440-3f47-add5-32b019b2e8c8",
                        "target_lang_word": "évangélique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "évangélique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a14300f7-1319-343a-9364-30e8d43fc1c1",
                                        "entry_id": "3e169a8a-56c5-3823-8792-9c9581e3874a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est de l’évangile ; qui est selon l’évangile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49c174ec-c3eb-41c0-a4fe-b71f4aac530c",
                                                "sense_id": "a14300f7-1319-343a-9364-30e8d43fc1c1",
                                                "text": "À bon entendeur, salut ! n’est pas seulement un précepte évangélique, c’est encore une excellente spéculation ; observez-le, on vous passera tout, jusqu’à des vices."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "161243d2-6dd1-49f3-8684-b87b18dbb9c1",
                                                "sense_id": "a14300f7-1319-343a-9364-30e8d43fc1c1",
                                                "text": "Je leur souhaite, comme vœu du Jour de l’An, de mener à bien leur entreprise et de ramener sur la terre l’âge évangélique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fa95a06-4c72-4804-be1a-aac41b891ce7",
                                                "sense_id": "a14300f7-1319-343a-9364-30e8d43fc1c1",
                                                "text": "Cette bienveillance, qui peut même parfois être vue telle une braise ardente venue du fond de ton être, est la mise en oeuvre de ce grand principe évangélique et si radicalement humain : « Aime ton prochain comme toi-même. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65085a24-d12e-3fcc-87e9-86571231d80c",
                                        "entry_id": "3e169a8a-56c5-3823-8792-9c9581e3874a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est adepte de l'évangélisme, branche du protestantisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1853a7f-bb4d-4b47-bcca-05826623d184",
                                                "sense_id": "65085a24-d12e-3fcc-87e9-86571231d80c",
                                                "text": "Les protestants évangéliques revendiquent le droit de dire leur foi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1894d97b-3931-3df5-af5f-606bac4bbf0a",
                                        "entry_id": "3e169a8a-56c5-3823-8792-9c9581e3874a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est adepte du protestantisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bf23559-b035-4ba2-8b7c-9dbd27a9627f",
                                                "sense_id": "1894d97b-3931-3df5-af5f-606bac4bbf0a",
                                                "text": "Qu'un catholique romain qui n'a jamais vu que le clocher de son village, qui n'a lu que son catéchisme et son livre d’heures, reproche aux chrétiens évangéliques leur défaut d'unité, à la bonne heure ! […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8429539f-2720-426c-b37a-ebc0f5ab419d",
                                                "sense_id": "1894d97b-3931-3df5-af5f-606bac4bbf0a",
                                                "text": "Vous savez que j'appartiens à la communion évangélique, de même que ma fiancée ; or, notre ministre, qui demeure à une trentaine de lieues, est perclus de la goutte, et j'ai osé espérer que vous voudriez bien officier à sa place."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "évangélique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fec94b1-1b05-3255-bb04-adad95988c35",
                                        "entry_id": "c3c160c6-34a4-338d-a708-331695815801",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Membre d'une église évangélique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b34dc58b-83a8-4f21-90c7-1ec60d21d944",
                                                "sense_id": "3fec94b1-1b05-3255-bb04-adad95988c35",
                                                "text": "Les évangéliques et les catholiques, tout en étant différents, se retrouvent sur de nombreux points, comme les questions d'éthique. La principale différence est l'autorité de la Bible, les évangéliques ont un rapport très personnel aux écritures, ils s'y réfèrent, ils la lisent régulièrement, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "595e2d5e-8143-3c85-931f-01b3bbe4e7ff",
